# Production and the safe VM deployment require two independent, high-entropy
# secrets. Never commit either value and never reuse the admin secret as the
# read-only secret. The safe deploy keeps every candidate Qdrant client on the
# read-only key until the forward-only `opened` phase has been persisted.
#
# Do not add these variables with empty values: Qdrant treats their presence as
# authentication configuration. Provision the real file on the VM with mode
# 0600, then recreate only the pinned Qdrant container with its existing
# storage and snapshot mounts during the dedicated one-time bootstrap window.
# QDRANT__SERVICE__API_KEY=<admin-secret-at-least-32-characters>
# QDRANT__SERVICE__READ_ONLY_API_KEY=<distinct-read-only-secret-at-least-32-characters>
